      "name": "dsh-session-inbox",
      "title": {
        "en": "DSH Session Workbench",
        "zh": "DSH 会话工作台"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Compact session workbench with rounded monochrome icons, floating Undo, native menus, search, keyboard navigation, metadata backups and an original-layout switch. Chinese UI. Version 0.4.5 supports 16 exact DSH releases: 0.1.7-rc.1/rc.2, 0.2.0-rc.1/rc.2, 0.2.1-alpha.1–alpha.5/rc.1–rc.5, 0.2.2-alpha.3/rc.1. All passed 13 isolated Windows Web checks each (208 total), plus 81 code/installer tests. Empty test sessions use a browser presentation fixture; no model API calls. Excludes 0.2.2-alpha.2 after native startup/session failures. Other platforms, live model turns and arbitrary third-party combinations remain unverified.",
        "zh": "圆角单色图标、底部浮动撤销、原生菜单、搜索、键盘操作、整理备份与原布局切换。中文界面。0.4.5 支持 16 个明确版本：0.1.7-rc.1/rc.2、0.2.0-rc.1/rc.2、0.2.1-alpha.1～alpha.5/rc.1～rc.5、0.2.2-alpha.3/rc.1。每版通过 13 项 Windows 隔离 Web 检查（共 208 项），另通过 81 项代码和安装器测试。空测试会话由浏览器夹具呈现为非空，未调用模型 API。0.2.2-alpha.2 因原生启动/创建会话失败未纳入。其他平台、真实模型对话与任意第三方插件组合仍未验收。"
      },
      "author": "Tracest",
      "homepage": "https://github.com/Tracest/dsh-session-inbox",
